WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,720 --> 00:00:04,740
What is your name? My name is Lin Ming.

2
00:00:06,390 --> 00:00:08,430
Lin Ming, the only man in Chi Da’s ruthless list

3
00:00:08,670 --> 00:00:10,270
The whole team from the small base approached him

4
00:00:10,270 --> 00:00:12,510
Warn once and kill them all, no one dares to mess with them

5
00:00:15,040 --> 00:00:16,520
The parents of this group

6
00:00:16,960 --> 00:00:18,680
He is really the lonely man who never has company

7
00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:21,480
Captain Beauty, what are you looking at? Look at a man.

8
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:31,130
You really want to go into the mountain. There was a landslide here some time ago. The road into the mountain has been completely changed. We know the road inside and can guide you. All we want is to burn our whole city. We will go down when we have a car.

9
00:00:31,690 --> 00:00:33,210
We will give you half of the supplies

10
00:00:33,770 --> 00:00:38,430
Then tell me one thing first, what is your artistic ability?

11
00:00:41,150 --> 00:00:44,130
My artistic ability is air shield. Bring people here.

12
00:00:44,690 --> 00:00:46,810
I'll take action against such a ruthless person
